{"id":"merret","name":"Merret","type":"character","aliases":["Daddy"],"description":"A dock worker under Grimbly who is desperate to improve his family's fortunes.","pages":2,"first_seen":"2018-10-10","last_seen":"2018-10-10","description_citations":[{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Grimbly Wothis","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Grimbly_Wothis","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Grimbly_Wothis","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors","text":"\"Grimbly Wothis\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors."}],"bio":null,"timeline":[{"id":"under-cover-fog-2018-10-10-e0","summary":"Merret, working the docks as a Dimir agent, nearly pockets a bottle of expensive whiskey from a crate before his boss approaches and he hides it.","participants":["merret","house-dimir"],"location":"ravnica","importance":"minor","page":"stories/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10","order":374,"story_date":"2018-10-10","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":2,"quote":"Sloppy, Merret, sloppy.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10#:~:text=Sloppy%2C%20Merret%2C%20sloppy.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Under the Cover of Fog","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2018-10-10","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10#:~:text=Sloppy%2C%20Merret%2C%20sloppy.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Under the Cover of Fog\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 10 Oct 2018."}},{"id":"under-cover-fog-2018-10-10-e1","summary":"Grimbly Wothis orders Merret to clear the fog from the harbor for an investor, threatening to dock his pay.","participants":["grimbly-wothis","merret"],"location":"ravnica","importance":"minor","pa